Fri Aug 21 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Team

- Disable repository package retention on the installed system, rewriting
  keeppackages to 0 in every /etc/zypp/repos.d entry so updates stop filling
  the disk with cached RPMs.
- Attempt every undo when an execution is cancelled or fails, reporting each
  cleanup failure while keeping the original operation failure as the primary
  outcome.
